{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"সুনান আন-নাসায়ী","section":{"34":"The Book of 'Umra"},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":3720,"hadithnumber_last":3760,"arabicnumber_first":3720,"arabicnumber_last":3760,"name_native":"উমরার কিতাব"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3722,"arabicnumber":3722,"text":"মুহাম্মাদ ইবন আবদুল্লাহ ইবন ইয়াযীদ (রহঃ) ... যায়দ ইবন সাবিত (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত যে, নবী সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম ওয়ারিসদের জন্য উমরার ফয়সালা দিয়েছেন।","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":3}},{"hadithnumber":3722.2,"arabicnumber":3722.2,"text":"","grades":[],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":4}}]}